    {
      "source": "The ID of the default timezone to use.",
      "translation": "默认时区的 ID。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Pattern conforming to an ISO 8601 date time string (without timezone).",
      "translation": "符合 ISO 8601 日期时间字符串（不含时区）的格式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2019–2026 <a href=\"https://neo4j.com\">Neo4j, Neo4j Sweden AB</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2019–2026 <a href=\"https://neo4j.com\">Neo4j、Neo4j Sweden AB</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Indicates SDN 6 to store dates as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> in the database. Applicable to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Date.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Date</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>.",
      "translation": "指示 SDN 6 将日期以 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 格式存储在数据库中。适用于\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Date.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Date</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Some temporals like <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>, representing an instantaneous point\nin time cannot be formatted with a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a>. In case you want\nto format an instant or similar with a default pattern, we assume a zone with the\ngiven id and default to UTC which is the same assumption that the\npredefined patterns in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a> take.",
      "translation": "某些时间类型（如 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>），表示瞬时时间点，无法使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a> 进行格式化。如果您希望以默认模式对瞬时时间或类似对象进行格式化，我们将假设使用给定 ID 时区，并默认为 UTC，这与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/format/DateTimeFormatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.format\"><code>DateTimeFormatter</code></a> 中预定义模式所采用的假设相同。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Some temporals like <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>, representing an instantaneous point\nin time cannot be formatted with a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a>.",
      "translation": "某些时间类型（如代表瞬时时间点的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Instant.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Instant</code></a>）无法使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a>进行格式化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Michael J. Simons",
      "translation": "迈克尔·J·西蒙斯",
      "count": 1
    },
